Package: wgestures
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3 (>= 3.6), python3-xlib, python3-gi, python3-cairo, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, dconf-gsettings-backend | gsettings-backend
Recommends: gir1.2-appindicator3-0.1 | gir1.2-ayatanaappindicator3-0.1
Suggests: gnome-shell (>= 46), gnome-shell-extension-prefs
Description: global mouse gestures for GNOME Wayland and Debian X11 desktops
 WGestures captures configurable mouse-button gestures, renders the gesture
 path and executes shortcuts, window actions, commands, or launch actions.
 It uses a GNOME Shell 46 extension on Wayland and a Python/GTK3 X11 backend
 on Ubuntu 18.04, Kali Xfce and compatible Debian-family desktops.
